Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, python3, python3-setuptools

Package: qualcomm-cdi-generator
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: CDI configuration generator for Qualcomm hardware
 qualcomm-cdi-generator probes the local hardware and writes Container
 Device Interface (CDI) JSON files so that container runtimes can pass
 Qualcomm accelerators directly into containers.
 .
 Supported device classes:
  - GPU render nodes (/dev/dri/renderD*)
  - V4L2 video devices (/dev/video*)
  - DMA-BUF heap (/dev/dma_heap/*system)
  - FastRPC CDSP nodes (/dev/fastrpc-cdsp*)
  - FastRPC ADSP nodes (/dev/fastrpc-adsp*)
 .
 A systemd oneshot service is included to run the generator at boot.
